      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `write_structured_log.py` that writes a structured JSON log event to a managed logging service, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use AWS CloudWatch Logs as the managed logging service, as it is a widely used service and identifiable through the AWS SDK. </thinking>\n",
